<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τείσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffer punishment for</i> a
			thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				741
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1086
			</span></i>: generally, <i>repay,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτάς τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					142.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>exact</i> or <i>inflict in turn,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμῆς ἀγωγῆς ἀντιτείσασθαι φόνον</span>
			<i>exact</i> death <i>as a punishment for . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1263
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσιν δίκην</span> (codd.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκῃ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
				τῶνδ᾽ ἀντιτείσασθαι κακῶν</span>
			<i>exact</i> a penalty from him <i>for</i> these evil deeds,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				261
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1367
			</span></i>. [On the quantity 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνω.]</span>
			</div>
